  "published": "2026-05-16T08:27:52.253Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v0.2.0-preview.1\n- Name-based fallback: non-indexed properties with matching names are mapped automatically.\n- BothWays API: Mapper.BothWays<T,D>() generates mappers for both directions.\n- MapMany API: Mapper.MapMany<T,D>(collection) bulk-maps to List<D>.\n- IQueryable projections: Mapper.Projection<T,D>() returns a compile-time Expression for EF Core .Select().\n- Profiles: organize mappings in MappSharkProfile-derived classes with CreateMap<T,D>().\n- MSP013 warning for [MapConverter] properties excluded from projections.",
